window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>They got away with murder once. He won’t let it happen again.</p> <p></p> <p>Faith left her hometown with a shattered heart and no justice for her murdered boyfriend.</p> <p></p> <p>His killers walked free.</p> <p></p> <p>Now she’s back.</p> <p></p> <p>And when her cousin is attacked at a party, it’s the same boys all over again.</p> <p></p> <p>Same lies. Same silence.</p> <p></p> <p>Until a masked stranger begins his hunt.</p> <p></p> <p>He’s cold, relentless, and all too familiar.</p> <p></p> <p>As the bodies start to fall, Faith is forced to face the past she buried.</p> <p></p> <p>Because this time, vengeance wears a face she thought she’d never see again.</p>"; 
